Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So everyone was finally reunited\Nexcept Sora. She was still upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because demi devimon told her\Nthat her crest of love would never
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glow demi devimon and my Myotismon\Nunleashed a vicious attack and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really hurt beumon the rest of\Nthe digimon tried to help but my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon was too powerful Biyomon\Nwanted to fight but Sora protected
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her That's when she realized\Nshe was acting just like a mom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:02:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protecting someone she loved Her\Ncrest then began to glow Helping
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bergermon digivolve to Garudamon\NAnd stopping Myotismon's attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Vamdemon's Castle of Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so funny, I forgot to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that my Otisman's chasing us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're gonna have to keep running like\Na bunch of crazed shoppers at the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a big creep, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have to agree with you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's small potatoes for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wish is to never see him again, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather round, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope lunch is ready,\Nbecause I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gennai's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to speak to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope he's found a way\Nto get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't keep us in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this all about, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I brought you some\Ngood news and some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which would you like to hear first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the good news for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate being depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a basket case anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you all look like\Nyou could use some cheering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been told another child\Nwill be joining your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another child?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who tells you these things anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is someone you\Nshall want as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This someone is a Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this new one\Nwill have a Digimon that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will be able to help\Nus. You and me both. The
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,important thing to remember\Nis that all eight of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be together As\Nlong as you are separated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the worlds will not be in harmony with\Neach other Everything will go wacko,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we must find that other child as\Nsoon as possible How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's someone my size\NI hope she's my size so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can swap clothes Tell us\Nsomething about this kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like what's his or her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:03:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's i forgot calm down i do know the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,location of the child it's japan huh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan? Where is Japan? Japan's a big\Nisland in the far east. Agumon and Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were transported there when our two\Nworlds converged if they ever converge
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again maybe we'll all get to go home\Nyeah remember that was the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to hear the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otis Mon has heard of the eighth\Nchild and will be going to Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gathering his forces as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he gets to the child\Nfirst, both of our worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doomed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need some spies on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The noodle-brainer team!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll whip them all into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These dweebs will be unbeatable\Nwhen I get through with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.57,0:05:11.54,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Nanimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.57,0:05:11.54,Sign,,370,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.57,0:05:11.54,Sign,,370,0,185,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.57,0:05:11.54,Sign,,370,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Invader Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.57,0:05:11.54,Sign,,370,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.57,0:05:11.54,Sign,,370,0,370,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Poop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nanimon is an invader Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd tell him what I really\Nthink about his sunglasses,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his power punch would flatten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, big boy, we know\Nyou can talk the talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it's time for\Nyou to do your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, too? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a couple of renegade soldiers\Nlooking for a battle to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But underneath our cool exterior,\Nwe're fighting machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Pankaguman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Reggae Palmon. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a couple of weirdos. You're\Nperfect. I'll take you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool. Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Myotismon, I have\Nsome good news to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The soldiers are assembled\Nand we're ready to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they worthy of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a bunch of helpless sea slugs,\Nif you want my opinion. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.52,0:06:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, little blue one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:19.39,Sign,,0,0,100,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Tailmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:19.39,Sign,,370,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:19.39,Sign,,370,0,185,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:19.39,Sign,,370,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Holy Beast Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:19.39,Sign,,370,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:19.39,Sign,,370,0,370,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Neko Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon might look like a harmless\Nlittle kitty, but deep down inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's an out-of-control wildcat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever cross her path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just where did you manage to find\Nthat group of goofballs anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could do better!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my paws tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, don't waste your time on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you done what I've asked of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.47,0:06:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Per your instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I searched everywhere and found the\Nmost ferocious Digimon I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be very pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I could trust you, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to meeting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it we prepare the\Nroom and it's ready for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your inspection fine the two\Nof you are dismissed right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind my asking\Nsir what is this room for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legends tell of this hollowed\Ngate it is the passageway
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that will take us forward\Nto the other world when we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pass through this portal\Nwill be free to infiltrate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the human realm according to\Nmy information the gate to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the other world should be\Nsomewhere inside this castle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my theory is that my\NMyotismon sent demi Devimon to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,distract us while he stayed\Nbehind to prepare the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly an ingenious plan on his part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good theory indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon and Palmon have\Ncertainly been gone a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I hope they're\Nlooking for the location of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wilting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hop like Bunnymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the jelly out of your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you guns to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle's gonna be big, so\Nget with it, you worthless warts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta try like you've\Nnever tried before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've tried we've never tried before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, why can't we start now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody that mouths\Noff will go without dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do understand me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the only reason we joined\Nthis dorky army in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to soak in a hot\Ntub for about two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got blisters on my blisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we have to stop this guy,\Nand I know how to do it. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a soldier with him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He likes to drink soda,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the bubbles go right to his head\Nand make him as dipsy as a doodle mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gets real kooky, and\Nhe'll do anything he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even let us escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be exhausted. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw a little pink\Nthing pop up and talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stomach will fill with bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's sure to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it explodes, won't he make\Nus hang around and clean it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the meds, we can all escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of us should go and get some soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't miss one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that slob wouldn't\Nlet us have dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll open the bottles and pour\Nthem down his throat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, contact sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is what he\Ngot for not feeding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're all tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a worthless pack of goons. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, he likes sake. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, have some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, anybody wanna go dancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wide on my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love that soda!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before he wakes up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bubble fizz won't last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried. Just be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we had a big bruiser on our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My signal is useless inside the\Ncastle, so you are on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got it covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must stop my Otis\NMon from carrying out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his plans and protect\Nyour friend in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must find the secret to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I understand the meaning of these\Ncards, the key will open the lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I will be able to enter\Nthe path to the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Digidestined think you're\Nso smart, but in reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am always one step ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a real funny feeling\Nabout this, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think something's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making any progress, Joe? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This lock's ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we had the key, it would open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and maybe if we had a\Ncannon, we could blast our way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's another way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I never get to be the hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's totally weird here what we've
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passed this way before\Nis that you Tai yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm up here have you found anything unusual\Ndown there izzy well you could say that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai the truth is you're way down there and\Nwe're up here i think you guys may need
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glasses we're way up here above you but
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way that's\Nscientifically impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm ready to proceed go\Nnow and tell our forces
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that no sacrifice is\Ntoo great in this moment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of glory right there's\Ncertainly no need to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them that they won't be\Nsharing in the rewards
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i hold all the cards\Nand they are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a mystery now all i need\Nis to find their digi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destined eighth child my\Ntheory is my oldest man
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has set up these optical\Nillusions to deter us
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from finding the gate\Nwell i'd say he succeeded
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're still as lost as\Nwe were before we started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all we've done so far\Nis go round and round
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in circles and we don't\Nknow up from down it's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making me dizzy huh\Nwhat's up someone's coming
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sure you doubt me\Nhuh i'm getting a bite
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they seem to know where\Nthey're going maybe we
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should try to follow them\Nthey'll lead us to the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right place. I shall now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be embarking on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:14:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to another world there\Nare forces which must
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be neutralized before\Nour victory here can be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complete but never fear\Ni shall return in triumph
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time to stand back and watch me\Nwork my magic open the gate to my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not going anywhere\Nnot as long as we can help it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:15:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is your name do you work for me\Ncan't you see i'm busy at the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah right demi devymond would you\Nplease take care of this annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gang of hoodlums i have better things\Nto do of course sir anything you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want i'm at your service i'm not letting\Nyou get past this gate Bad chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you little twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours, Nanimon. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about passing by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.45,0:15:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Digi-doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's fight. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to fight you guys,\Nbut the future is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, Digivolve to Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve into champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ordered everyone back into ranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll buy you dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going for some fast food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're big!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody need a wrestling coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't resign!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to bet, Pipsqueak,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when it comes down to having my\Nfanny kicked, I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if you don't believe me, you might\Ncheck the fine print of my contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me stand in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could have us a war to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just admit you picked the wrong\Nside and give it a rest already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to\Nfrighten me, it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as long as we can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't dealt with me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so funny, I forgot to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this for an instant bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't dealt with me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the gate, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.29,0:18:00.80,Sign,,0,0,100,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Devidramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.29,0:18:00.80,Sign,,370,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.29,0:18:00.80,Sign,,370,0,185,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.29,0:18:00.80,Sign,,370,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Evil Dragon Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.29,0:18:00.80,Sign,,370,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.29,0:18:00.80,Sign,,370,0,370,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Crimson Nail
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devidramon, he's one nasty\Ndragon guarding the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Debbie doesn't like losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want a real surprise,\Nlook into his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be hypnotized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Illigino Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had enough needle spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop there for some\Nawesome fighting We got
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be by mine! You haven't\Nwon yet! Gate's closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.96,0:18:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, you flying feedback. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going through Move up This way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to make a run\Nfor it while we have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Braymon, Digital Braymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear sailing from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get through that gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your mitts off of me!\NGet back! Get out of our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready to jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gates are closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
